{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The grand sports festival of spirits, held once every hundred years... is now open!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A competitive racing game where you compete in two separate lanes, top and bottom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The key to victory lies in &quot;Parry&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When an enemy appears, jump! While in the air, press the jump button again... Let's Parry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeated enemies are sealed in the Parry stock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By pressing the launch button, you can fire the &quot;Obstruction Cannon&quot; at your opponent's lane!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send defeated obstructions back and disrupt your opponent's run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally! There is a new &quot;Bread Eating Competition Mode&quot; where you compete to see who can eat more bread before reaching the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*More characters and courses are planned to be added in future updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3596720?t=1743909431","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596720/c7b2e607e94991d9e4273daff7ed4bdf98bc5490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743909431","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596720/ea1e6a9c5e317974d89cdfae97040b945a2450bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743909431","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596720/ea1e6a9c5e317974d89cdfae97040b945a2450bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743909431","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The grand sports festival of spirits, held once every hundred years... is now open!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A competitive racing game where you compete in two separate lanes, top and bottom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The key to victory lies in &quot;Parry&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When an enemy appears, jump! While in the air, press the jump button again... Let's Parry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeated enemies are sealed in the Parry stock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By pressing the launch button, you can fire the &quot;Obstruction Cannon&quot; at your opponent's lane!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send defeated obstructions back and disrupt your opponent's run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally! There is a new &quot;Bread Eating Competition Mode&quot; where you compete to see who can eat more bread before reaching the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*More characters and courses are planned to be added in future updates.</p>","developers":["\u3042\u3081\u3080\u3057\u5de5\u623f"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596720/5c84068c591d326faec768f0448dbe6f77b5a512/header.jpg?t=1743909431","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115107,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail